{"parentUuid": null, "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "/home/tester/Projects/homelab", "sessionId": "5e1f0a7c-3d2b-4c8e-9a61-7b0d2e4f8c15", "version": "2.1.330", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "user", "uuid": "033cc6e0-57f9-59f3-850d-f9972ea9e0d0", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T18:00:00.000Z", "message": {"role": "user", "content": "Hi. Today we set up the backup for the garden shed server, the little machine called ortolan. It is a Raspberry Pi 5 with a 1 TB SSD."}}
{"parentUuid": "033cc6e0-57f9-59f3-850d-f9972ea9e0d0", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "/home/tester/Projects/homelab", "sessionId": "5e1f0a7c-3d2b-4c8e-9a61-7b0d2e4f8c15", "version": "2.1.330", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "assistant", "uuid": "483c0c52-7c80-5283-99c8-1cff6a06d93f", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T18:00:40.000Z", "message": {"id": "msg_c6e537b4010d552dacc86323", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Understood: ortolan is the Raspberry Pi 5 in the garden shed with a 1 TB SSD. What should it back up, and where to?"}], "stop_reason": "end_turn", "stop_sequence": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 1200, "output_tokens": 80}}, "requestId": "req_1963f45becbf548592382ae7"}
{"parentUuid": "483c0c52-7c80-5283-99c8-1cff6a06d93f", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "/home/tester/Projects/homelab", "sessionId": "5e1f0a7c-3d2b-4c8e-9a61-7b0d2e4f8c15", "version": "2.1.330", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "user", "uuid": "22eef1ad-6920-5d99-8eb1-1cbdb9290deb", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T18:01:30.000Z", "message": {"role": "user", "content": "It backs up the photo archive from the house NAS, the one we call quercia. Quercia keeps about 600 GB of photos."}}
{"parentUuid": "22eef1ad-6920-5d99-8eb1-1cbdb9290deb", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "/home/tester/Projects/homelab", "sessionId": "5e1f0a7c-3d2b-4c8e-9a61-7b0d2e4f8c15", "version": "2.1.330", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "assistant", "uuid": "c860bb39-0463-5040-a7c7-c75dbe7771e2", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T18:02:10.000Z", "message": {"id": "msg_59aac31d6b1851f4a7992f34", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "So quercia, the house NAS, holds about 600 GB of photos, and ortolan keeps a second copy out in the shed. That fits on the 1 TB SSD with room for growth."}], "stop_reason": "end_turn", "stop_sequence": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 1200, "output_tokens": 80}}, "requestId": "req_3403f9a371995e68bbe0b249"}
{"parentUuid": "c860bb39-0463-5040-a7c7-c75dbe7771e2", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "/home/tester/Projects/homelab", "sessionId": "5e1f0a7c-3d2b-4c8e-9a61-7b0d2e4f8c15", "version": "2.1.330", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "user", "uuid": "48ecb393-8a8f-5aee-85aa-0668395a9295", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T18:03:00.000Z", "message": {"role": "user", "content": "My sister Livia also stores her scans on quercia, under a folder called livia-scans."}}
{"parentUuid": "48ecb393-8a8f-5aee-85aa-0668395a9295", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "/home/tester/Projects/homelab", "sessionId": "5e1f0a7c-3d2b-4c8e-9a61-7b0d2e4f8c15", "version": "2.1.330", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "assistant", "uuid": "ff8f1f77-580b-5a35-8eef-f19beb32285d", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T18:03:40.000Z", "message": {"id": "msg_b6abf7728ff35c8abfa7aeba", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Noted: Livia's scans live on quercia in livia-scans. Should they be part of the backup too?"}], "stop_reason": "end_turn", "stop_sequence": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 1200, "output_tokens": 80}}, "requestId": "req_5e0150ccb4cd51d08414e535"}
{"parentUuid": "ff8f1f77-580b-5a35-8eef-f19beb32285d", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "/home/tester/Projects/homelab", "sessionId": "5e1f0a7c-3d2b-4c8e-9a61-7b0d2e4f8c15", "version": "2.1.330", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "user", "uuid": "67bfeaae-dec6-55e9-8150-3116045de95b", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T18:04:30.000Z", "message": {"role": "user", "content": "Yes, include them. Livia asked for it last week."}}
{"parentUuid": "67bfeaae-dec6-55e9-8150-3116045de95b", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "/home/tester/Projects/homelab", "sessionId": "5e1f0a7c-3d2b-4c8e-9a61-7b0d2e4f8c15", "version": "2.1.330", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "assistant", "uuid": "98bc4aeb-cc64-562f-a850-26beeb9ca24c", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T18:05:10.000Z", "message": {"id": "msg_12c38864fdab5a91ab4e6b14", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I will include livia-scans in the same job. One copy of everything on quercia's photo and scan folders goes to ortolan."}], "stop_reason": "end_turn", "stop_sequence": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 1200, "output_tokens": 80}}, "requestId": "req_5a3dc0fa720b5c5ab594662c"}
{"parentUuid": "98bc4aeb-cc64-562f-a850-26beeb9ca24c", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "/home/tester/Projects/homelab", "sessionId": "5e1f0a7c-3d2b-4c8e-9a61-7b0d2e4f8c15", "version": "2.1.330", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "user", "uuid": "a366bedb-1c0c-5211-b93f-03679539ad48", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T18:06:00.000Z", "message": {"role": "user", "content": "What tool do you suggest for the copy?"}}
{"parentUuid": "a366bedb-1c0c-5211-b93f-03679539ad48", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "/home/tester/Projects/homelab", "sessionId": "5e1f0a7c-3d2b-4c8e-9a61-7b0d2e4f8c15", "version": "2.1.330", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "assistant", "uuid": "d7d90fb8-fb75-5cdc-bbfe-02c112c89173", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T18:06:40.000Z", "message": {"id": "msg_438b8cd4495b582997f7a889", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "rsync over ssh is enough for a one-way copy. I suggest a nightly run at 02:00, when nobody uses the NAS, with --delete off so a mistake on quercia never removes the backup copy."}], "stop_reason": "end_turn", "stop_sequence": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 1200, "output_tokens": 80}}, "requestId": "req_1b60e0a80b70554e8258c747"}
{"parentUuid": "d7d90fb8-fb75-5cdc-bbfe-02c112c89173", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "/home/tester/Projects/homelab", "sessionId": "5e1f0a7c-3d2b-4c8e-9a61-7b0d2e4f8c15", "version": "2.1.330", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "user", "uuid": "a196b263-359d-5944-a2ec-c768a57ef1dd", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T18:07:30.000Z", "message": {"role": "user", "content": "Good, we decide that: rsync nightly at 02:00, no --delete."}}
{"parentUuid": "a196b263-359d-5944-a2ec-c768a57ef1dd", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "/home/tester/Projects/homelab", "sessionId": "5e1f0a7c-3d2b-4c8e-9a61-7b0d2e4f8c15", "version": "2.1.330", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "assistant", "uuid": "c72e81b8-bf69-5f7d-8874-a73b566fa0b9", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T18:08:10.000Z", "message": {"id": "msg_2cf05054f541570683b976c6", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Decision recorded: nightly rsync from quercia to ortolan at 02:00, without --delete."}], "stop_reason": "end_turn", "stop_sequence": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 1200, "output_tokens": 80}}, "requestId": "req_b0fd5450f0ff5fc893be05b4"}
{"parentUuid": "c72e81b8-bf69-5f7d-8874-a73b566fa0b9", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "/home/tester/Projects/homelab", "sessionId": "5e1f0a7c-3d2b-4c8e-9a61-7b0d2e4f8c15", "version": "2.1.330", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "user", "uuid": "df4ce703-0d6d-5df0-8de8-50cfa9dda45e", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T18:09:00.000Z", "message": {"role": "user", "content": "Run a first test copy now."}}
{"parentUuid": "df4ce703-0d6d-5df0-8de8-50cfa9dda45e", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "/home/tester/Projects/homelab", "sessionId": "5e1f0a7c-3d2b-4c8e-9a61-7b0d2e4f8c15", "version": "2.1.330", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "assistant", "uuid": "6294cda5-9d62-5e1a-b259-ee27924f0fa5", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T18:09:40.000Z", "message": {"id": "msg_4cabacc2ef605bbdbab1066c", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I ran the first copy, but I pointed it at /mnt/backup, which is the SD card, not the SSD. It filled the card after 30 GB and stopped."}], "stop_reason": "end_turn", "stop_sequence": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 1200, "output_tokens": 80}}, "requestId": "req_3fbac77ad888565c86524624"}
{"parentUuid": "6294cda5-9d62-5e1a-b259-ee27924f0fa5", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "/home/tester/Projects/homelab", "sessionId": "5e1f0a7c-3d2b-4c8e-9a61-7b0d2e4f8c15", "version": "2.1.330", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "user", "uuid": "fffc629b-c34f-5907-9e1f-bb6ef75a6891", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T18:10:30.000Z", "message": {"role": "user", "content": "So the SSD was not mounted?"}}
{"parentUuid": "fffc629b-c34f-5907-9e1f-bb6ef75a6891", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "/home/tester/Projects/homelab", "sessionId": "5e1f0a7c-3d2b-4c8e-9a61-7b0d2e4f8c15", "version": "2.1.330", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "assistant", "uuid": "9ea4a29e-23c9-532c-b1bb-bd76bc40d64a", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T18:11:10.000Z", "message": {"id": "msg_72f3c6fecc1854d2a4c63a2b", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Right. The SSD mounts at /mnt/ssd, and /mnt/backup is a folder on the SD card. I should have checked the mount with findmnt before copying. I removed the partial copy from the card and pointed the job at /mnt/ssd/quercia."}], "stop_reason": "end_turn", "stop_sequence": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 1200, "output_tokens": 80}}, "requestId": "req_36fec09c9a4855b99fb6acb2"}
{"parentUuid": "9ea4a29e-23c9-532c-b1bb-bd76bc40d64a", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "/home/tester/Projects/homelab", "sessionId": "5e1f0a7c-3d2b-4c8e-9a61-7b0d2e4f8c15", "version": "2.1.330", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "user", "uuid": "0ea656bf-47d5-5a84-8cf8-72a8207a6983", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T18:12:00.000Z", "message": {"role": "user", "content": "Please remember that for next time."}}
{"parentUuid": "0ea656bf-47d5-5a84-8cf8-72a8207a6983", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "/home/tester/Projects/homelab", "sessionId": "5e1f0a7c-3d2b-4c8e-9a61-7b0d2e4f8c15", "version": "2.1.330", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "assistant", "uuid": "e9df102e-50d1-52b8-84fe-de60bcb4c0d3", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T18:12:40.000Z", "message": {"id": "msg_ab08bd6199795a95bf60c2d3", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "mistake: I copied the backup to /mnt/backup on ortolan's SD card instead of the SSD at /mnt/ssd, because I did not check the mount point before the first copy."}], "stop_reason": "end_turn", "stop_sequence": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 1200, "output_tokens": 80}}, "requestId": "req_d819e665f3065cb89bffc31b"}
{"parentUuid": "e9df102e-50d1-52b8-84fe-de60bcb4c0d3", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "/home/tester/Projects/homelab", "sessionId": "5e1f0a7c-3d2b-4c8e-9a61-7b0d2e4f8c15", "version": "2.1.330", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "user", "uuid": "16371efe-39fb-5c91-ab45-22793849e2e8", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T18:13:30.000Z", "message": {"role": "user", "content": "And the general rule?"}}
{"parentUuid": "16371efe-39fb-5c91-ab45-22793849e2e8", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "/home/tester/Projects/homelab", "sessionId": "5e1f0a7c-3d2b-4c8e-9a61-7b0d2e4f8c15", "version": "2.1.330", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "assistant", "uuid": "2f708684-683d-5bbb-a85d-664abf4f87d7", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T18:14:10.000Z", "message": {"id": "msg_4b454bef68a25942930567f6", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "learned_lesson: before writing a large copy to a disk, confirm with findmnt that the target path is on that disk and not on the system card."}], "stop_reason": "end_turn", "stop_sequence": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 1200, "output_tokens": 80}}, "requestId": "req_817e1ddcd5895d2e955077e0"}
{"parentUuid": "2f708684-683d-5bbb-a85d-664abf4f87d7", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "/home/tester/Projects/homelab", "sessionId": "5e1f0a7c-3d2b-4c8e-9a61-7b0d2e4f8c15", "version": "2.1.330", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "user", "uuid": "d717b8d8-eb72-55af-aefa-3da67807456c", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T18:15:00.000Z", "message": {"role": "user", "content": "Run the copy again on the SSD."}}
